Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:06.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 是什么把我引向我的男人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* What drives me to my man
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.14,0:00:15.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 无论是世俗的、神圣的，还是别的什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Earthly or divine or otherwise *
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:26.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 都不关我的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Is no business of mine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:38.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 你浪费了我的时间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* You wasted my time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:50.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 内心深处，我从来就没觉得对劲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Deep down, I never did feel right *
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 即使现在，有时候……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Even now, sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.39,0:00:57.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.29,0:00:59.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特？嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.53,0:01:02.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。*……那种感觉是个谎言\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. *...that feeling's a lie
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.53,0:01:03.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:06.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我倒想问你同样的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I could ask you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:09.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丹弄到了2C-E。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dan got 2C-E.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.14,0:01:13.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像是种合成毒品，我们吃了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like a designer drug, and we took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:16.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们像小丑一样……不是好笑的那种。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We were clowns for... Not the funny kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:19.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都飘到天花板上去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was on the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我挺喜欢的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.82,0:01:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听起来真是特别，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That sounds very special,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很遗憾我没在场指指点点笑话你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'm sorry that I wasn't there to point and laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.89,0:01:27.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道瑞秋在哪吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know where Rachel is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.69,0:01:29.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……她也飘到天花板上去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, well... she was on the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.72,0:01:30.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样吧，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:32.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，呃，我得去把\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, uh, I need to go finish
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.53,0:01:34.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}婚礼的剧本写完。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}writing the scripts for the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你要不要回家，我们，呃，搂着你睡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you want to come home and we'll, uh, spoon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.83,0:01:39.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很想，但今晚不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would love to do that, but not tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:41.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且你满脸都是东西，所以不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you have stuff all over your face, so no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.77,0:01:43.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得去把大结局弄完。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got to go finish the finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.80,0:01:45.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.91,0:01:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，宝贝，我们去找吃的，肉干。你要肉干吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, boo, let's get food, jerky. You want jerky?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.18,0:01:54.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 一颗渴望已久的心，噢，只求一点点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* A heart long-desperate, oh, for just a little bit *
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:58.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！停一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Stop, for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:02:00.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底以为自己要去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where the hell do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:08.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 一颗渴望已久的心，噢，为我一直拥有的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* A heart long-desperate, oh, for something I had all along *
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.97,0:02:20.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我不需要你的爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I don't need your love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.21,0:02:25.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我不需要你的爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I don't need your love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.48,0:02:32.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我不需要你理解\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I don't need you to understand *
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:38.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我需要你听\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I need you to listen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.79,0:02:42.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干杯，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cheers, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，我是，呃……老天，真抱歉我迟到了。我刚在收拾行李。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, I'm, uh... God, I'm so sorry I'm late. I was just packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我有点情绪激动，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I got kind of emotional,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:51.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我真是准备好换层新皮了，你懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I am just so ready for some new skin, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.70,0:02:53.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:55.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:58.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，不太算。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:02:59.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.75,0:03:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。我做不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so sorry. I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:07.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我说的每句话都是真心的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I meant everything I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:12.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我有机会好好想了想，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I had a chance to think about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:15.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们之间这东西……是海洛因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and this thing we have... It's heroin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.56,0:03:18.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它会烧尽，留下我们其中一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll burn out and leave one of us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.27,0:03:21.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}独自死在巴黎的酒吧里，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}dying alone in a bar in Paris,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.64,0:03:24.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且……如果是我，我能接受，但不能是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and... I can live with that if it's me, but not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:27.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更别说如果我们现在就走，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to mention the fact that if we leave right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:29.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会伤害很多人，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we're gonna hurt a lot of people, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:30.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我靠，亚当，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy shit, Adam,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.58,0:03:32.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚刚因为你求我，把自己整个人生都烧了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just burned my entire life down because you begged me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:34.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，我知道，可是瑞秋，你太有感染力了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, I know, but, Rachel, you are so compelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.85,0:03:36.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:39.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我做了承诺，我得成熟点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I made a commitment, and I have to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要信守我的承诺。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm honoring my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:46.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你对我的承诺呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about the promise that you made me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:48.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是你只是酒醒了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or did you just sober up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:50.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你对我来说就是一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, you mean everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们在一起对我们没好处。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we're not good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.60,0:03:57.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我明白了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:03.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出租车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cab!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.98,0:04:05.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，瑞秋……出租车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, Rachel... Cab!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:07.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，瑞秋！出租车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, Rachel! Cab!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去给我弄点咖啡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go get me some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:28.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，好孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.77,0:04:30.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别……现在不行。噢，就现在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't... not now. Oh, yes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:32.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你应该跪下来感谢上帝让我找到你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should be on your knees thanking God that I found you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:34.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在你犯下人生最大的错误之前，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}before you made the biggest mistake of your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.01,0:04:36.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这话可不是随便说说的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that's saying something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:37.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚刚毁了她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just ruined her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:38.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:42.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋自己就能毁得很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel does that just fine on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:46.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望你明白，我不是怪物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to understand I'm not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:48.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。你也不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. And neither are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:50.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋能勾引任何人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel can seduce anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:55.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是我在这儿的原因……保护她不被自己害了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why I'm here... To protect her from herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.03,0:04:56.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，不用谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:05:00.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底给不给我办婚礼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you giving me a wedding or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:01.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行，好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:03.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但既然要做，就做对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But if we're gonna do this, let's do it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.60,0:05:05.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想去伦敦，在那儿办。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to go to London and do it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.44,0:05:06.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢。定了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Love it. Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:09.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完美。不过你没问题吧，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perfect. Are you okay, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:10.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让瑞秋继续当你的制作人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with Rachel still being your producer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.98,0:05:12.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我没事。谢谢。我自己当制作人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm good. Thank you. I'll produce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，那么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:16.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好先去跟安娜道歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You better start by apologizing to Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:19.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让人独自醒来？可不算什么迷人举动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Waking up alone? Not a sexy move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.81,0:05:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:47.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想着你可能需要这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thought you might need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:50.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你决定回来了，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You decided to come back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:52.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，那件事我很抱歉，我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm so sorry about that. I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:55.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我半夜醒过来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I woke up in the middle of the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:57.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你人不见了，东西也带走了不少，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you were gone with a lot of your stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.09,0:06:00.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我想，我还是回这儿来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I figured I should just come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:04.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，听着，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, look, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.10,0:06:08.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直在想，这儿到底什么是真的，你懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been trying to figure out what's real here, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，整件事都很蠢，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. This whole thing's stupid
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在直播电视上结婚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and getting married on live TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:13.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们几乎不认识对方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We hardly know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.01,0:06:15.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，这真是疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it's legitimately mental.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:17.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:20.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，昨晚很棒。你知道的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, last night was amazing. You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:22.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.48,0:06:25.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我们能不能就……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, can we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.55,0:06:29.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能为我再坚持一下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you hang in there for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再撑一小段时间？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For a little while longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:34.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:39.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“去拿咖啡”这几个字你哪部分听不懂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What part of "get coffee" do you not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.10,0:06:42.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！你好，布拉德。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Hello, Brad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:45.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我是莫莉，替布拉德打的电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, this is Molly calling on behalf of Brad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你好啊，替布拉德打电话的莫莉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, well, hello, Molly calling on behalf of Brad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.11,0:06:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是想通知你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I just wanted to let you know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:52.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布拉德不得不取消你的提案会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that Brad had to cancel your pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:53.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}取消？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cancel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.81,0:06:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是我们昨晚才当面确认过的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, but we just personally confirmed it last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:06:59.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，奎恩，别这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Quinn. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.55,0:07:01.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我、我都把日程空出来了，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I-I cleared my schedule, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:03.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:05.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他能再重新安排一下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, can he r-reschedule again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:08.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，什么……什么时候……他什么时候有空？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, when... when... When is he available again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不确定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个我们得之后再回复你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna have to get back to you on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，换句话说就是“永远没空”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, so, in other words, "never."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你刚才用好莱坞话说的就是这个意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause that's what you just said in Hollywood-speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.07,0:07:19.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真抱歉，我能让你稍等一下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so sorry. Can I put you on hold for one minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:21.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事，其实我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's fine, actually, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保重，替我向布拉德问好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take care and just tell Brad I send my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:28.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，奎恩，片场需要你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Quinn, they need you on set.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:29.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别烦我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:31.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉她了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:41.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这下有意思了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. This should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:43.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞什么，长袜子皮皮？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell, Longstocking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:46.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特和瓦格斯坦博士来这儿是为了确保\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Chet and Dr. Wagerstein are here to make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.20,0:07:48.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会逼我做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you don't push me into doing something
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想做的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that I don't want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:53.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，切特早就把这事办了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, pretty sure Chet took care of that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.77,0:07:55.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，他没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.11,0:07:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那都是双方自愿的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was all consensual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:07:58.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，真贴心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aw, that is so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:01.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特教你这词之后，你还得去谷歌一下才懂吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you have to Google that word after Chet fed it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.82,0:08:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你再试着说一遍，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, try and say it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:05.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说快点，说不定还能拼出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}except faster and maybe you can spell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.69,0:08:07.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是“自—愿—的”……别为难这姑娘了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, con-sens-u... Leave the girl alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:10.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关键是那场官司会毁了她，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The bottom line is that lawsuit would damage her
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:11.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}却让你得利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and benefit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:13.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你心里清楚。哦，是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know that. Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:14.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这全是你自己想到的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She just came to that all on her own?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:16.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，是我。拜托，别说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I did. Please, stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，切特？她还是个孩子，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what, Chet? She is a child, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.13,0:08:19.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能指望她说实话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You cannot expect her to tell the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:21.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还坐在这儿磨蹭你的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with you sitting here dawdling on your...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.07,0:08:23.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:25.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是制片人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.81,0:08:26.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:28.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪逊会做你的新外景制片人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison's gonna be your new field producer,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:31.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得把瓦格斯坦博士写进节目里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you need to write Dr. Wagerstein into the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:33.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多点菲尔博士那种桥段。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, more Dr. Phil-type moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去。走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:39.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你留下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:47.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以布拉德突然“永远没空”就是因为这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, this is why Brad is suddenly "unavailable" forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:49.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，你找上他，把水搅浑了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, you got to him and you poisoned the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.16,0:08:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这简直是职业暗杀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, that is career assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:53.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那对我提强奸指控，那就不算……不算了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And bringing rape charges against me, that's... that's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.37,0:08:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，你在干什么？我们订婚了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, what are you doing? We're engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.07,0:08:59.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我逮到你让一个十几岁的小姑娘给你口交。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I caught you getting your knob polished by a teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:00.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧。她就是个嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever. She's a mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，也许我该更谨慎一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, maybe I could have been a little more prudent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:04.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪，切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, good God, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.14,0:09:06.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让我每次硬了就到处求人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want me begging every time I get a boner?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.35,0:09:08.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我一天得扑你五次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd be mauling you five times a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:09.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我是什么人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:11.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:14.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来以为，我不在城里的时候，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I thought maybe you could keep getting your happy endings
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以继续在外面找你的“完美结局”，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}while I was out of town,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:17.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你睡了我的手下，还是个小孩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but banging a kid that works for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:18.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太恶心了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:21.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先，那只是口交，而且是个意外。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First of all, it was a blow job, and it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.39,0:09:22.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:24.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为她就是十五年前的我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause she was me 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:26.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.07,0:09:29.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以现在我是老婆……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, now I'm the wifey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:35.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要新的小情人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you need a new side piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.71,0:09:37.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吧，对，没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, sure, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.21,0:09:40.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪逊是个蠢货，可我们刚开始乱搞时我也蠢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison's an idiot, but so was I when we started fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:43.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩……我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn... Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.28,0:09:45.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我真的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think that I actually
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:48.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始相信我们在这儿卖的那些鬼话了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}started to believe the crap that we sell here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:51.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:57.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有妓女，没有小姑娘，只有我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Without hookers or teenagers or anything but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:10:02.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为我们就是这样……真爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what I thought we had... True love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:05.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.24,0:10:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:14.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.15,0:10:15.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直在找你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:19.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得Adam昨晚搞砸了，我不是指字面意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think Adam blew it last night, and I don't mean literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:20.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说Adam放她鸽子了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I heard Adam bailed on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.89,0:10:23.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我觉得我有机会了，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I think I have an opening, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:24.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得呢？天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think? Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:26.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你绝对该去争取。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should totally go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:29.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也这么想……要么大干一场，要么别干，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what I'm thinking... Go big or go home, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:35.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看起来美极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you look like a million bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.27,0:10:36.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}省省吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? Save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.90,0:10:40.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两件事……第一，你想敲诈我，去你的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two things... one, screw you for trying to blackmail me,
