Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:18.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但考虑到你那，呃，Lady Gaga式的妆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, I mean, given the, uh, Lady Gaga make up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.01,0:11:20.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有那条沾泥的裙子，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the muddy dress,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.18,0:11:23.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜这里有私人动机吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm assuming there's some kind of personal motivation here?
