Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，然后……天一亮他就变卦了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, and then... light of day changed his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:37.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然了，我有真正的男人和真正的生活，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, I mean, I have, like, a real guy and a real life,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我……谁？Jeremy？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I... Who? Jeremy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:40.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算了，那个还能挽救。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever, you can salvage that.
