Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.01,0:11:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}婚礼杂志，全贴了标签。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wedding mags, all tabbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:51.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很丢人，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's humiliating, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.51,0:11:53.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Quinn当漂亮公主\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn as the pretty-pretty princess
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:55.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}配她那吸毒的已婚王子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with her drug-addict, married prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:11:58.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我发现那死胖子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, and then I found the fat jerk
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.52,0:12:01.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让Madison给他口交。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}getting a blow job from Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:03.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的……我以为我把他逼到绝路了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I really... I thought I had him cornered.
