Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:07.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但那走运的混蛋发现了，还来了个终局\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But then that lucky bastard found out and ran an end game
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.53,0:12:10.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以现在我在电视台彻底完了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and so now I am dead at the network,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后，惊喜吧，困在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and, shocker, stuck here.
