Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.53,0:12:15.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总有办法在Brad面前让他出丑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's got to be a way to show him up in front of Brad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:17.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们说的是Chet啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, we're talking about Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.91,0:12:21.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right? Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.14,0:12:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为你稳操胜券，但我听说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think you got it all locked up, but I heard
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:26.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天早上Adam不在某人床上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that Adam was missing from someone's bed this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:28.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不，我们已经聊过这个了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, we talked about that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:30.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:31.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他去散步了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He took a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:33.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他兴奋得睡不着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He couldn't sleep because he was so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:36.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后他为醒来时不在我身边道歉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then he apologized for not being there when I woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.39,0:12:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给她发邮件。告诉Paige我得了单核细胞增多症。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll e-mail her. Tell Paige I got mono.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.99,0:12:39.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发给我。我保证会签字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Send it to me. I promise you I'll sign it.
