Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.27,0:12:47.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rach，搞什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:49.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一整天都在给你发短信。真对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been texting you like all day. I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.47,0:12:51.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我今早不是故意让你担心的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I-I-I did not mean to worry you this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:52.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们刚打给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They just called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.91,0:12:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像是清晨的准备会，但……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was like an early morning prep session, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:59.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那张纸条，对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I'm sorry about that note.
