Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:04.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没收到吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you not get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:05.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:08.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是那种，呃，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-It was just like one of those, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:10.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女生发疯写的蠢纸条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}stupid, girly freak-out notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:12.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很蠢，不过，嗯，现在都没事了，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was stupid, but, um, everything's fine now, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.59,0:13:15.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你个怪人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.60,0:13:18.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，大家快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, let's hustle, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:21.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五分钟后开拍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rolling in five.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Anna，Grace，欢迎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna, Grace, welcome.
