Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:30.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向你们中的一个问出那个一生一次的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and ask one of you the question of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.98,0:13:33.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但首先，今天加入我们的是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But first, joining us today
