Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:47.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Adam告诉我他一直想要传统英式婚礼，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam told me he's always wanted a traditional English wedding,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我想的是戴安娜王妃、格蕾丝·凯利那种。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I'm thinking Princess Di, Grace Kelly.
