Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:13:58.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和那些死板传统\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and stuffy traditions
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:00.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而更关乎新生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and more about the new life
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.41,0:14:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和Adam要一起过的新生活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that Adam and I are gonna have together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:04.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想象这一刻很久了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've pictured this moment for a really long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.64,0:14:06.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你美极了。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look gorgeous. Thank you.
