Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.27,0:14:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是……布兰妮，你不能这样，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not... Britney, you can't do that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.27,0:14:30.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？布兰妮来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is happening? Britney's here.
