Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:33.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是制片人，自己去想办法。哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a producer, go figure it out. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:35.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我喜欢这件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I love this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:36.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能就这么闯进我的片场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't just step onto my set.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:39.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。你是说像你老板切特昨晚邀请我那样吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. You mean like your boss, Chet, invited me to last night?
