Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:43.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后解释你又想坑我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and explain that you're trying to screw me over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.68,0:14:46.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特？没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.39,0:14:47.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:51.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以别用你那水汪汪的屎眼盯着我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, stop looking at me with those watery turd eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:55.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后给我拿条该死的婚纱来，贱人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and get me a damn wedding dress, bitch.
