Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尤其是有……玛丽，那真是最糟的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Especially with having... Mary, that was just the worst.
