Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.31,0:20:41.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但最近挺戏剧化的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it's been pretty dramatic lately, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.41,0:20:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.74,0:20:44.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨晚，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last night, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:46.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她告诉我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She did?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:52.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在不会打我吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not gonna hit me right now, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:53.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，我不怪你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, I wouldn't blame you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果你能等到婚礼之后，随你打。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but if you can just wait till after the wedding, then you can have at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.39,0:20:59.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没必要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:01.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真是大度。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's big of you, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，那只是一时冲动，我们有点失控，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, it was just a fling, and we got a little carried away,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:06.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们绝不会私奔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but we're never gonna run away together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:07.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.57,0:21:10.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我……我明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I-I... I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:13.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来我们都躲过一劫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guess we both dodged a bullet on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.41,0:21:19.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你告诉格蕾丝你跟亚当睡了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you told Grace that you slept with Adam
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.45,0:21:21.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她还想嫁给他。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and she still wants to marry him. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:23.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还有话没说完，但听着，比如说下一季，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look I'm not done yet, but, listen, say next season,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.55,0:21:25.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切顺利，我们说了算，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this all works out, we're in control, right?
