Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.92,0:21:31.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们是杰出的公职人员？再来点蜡烛。再多点蜡烛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who are like distinguished public servants? More candles, please. More candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.36,0:21:34.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无聊。他们在皇家芭蕾舞团工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bored. They work at the Royal Ballet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.39,0:21:36.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更无聊。好吧，芭蕾？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bored-er. All right, ballet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:38.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们没胸。政客。华盛顿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They don't have boobs. Politicians. D.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.63,0:21:41.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，华盛顿是丑人的好莱坞，懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, D.C. is Hollywood for ugly people, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别站着！你们该干活了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop standing around! You should be doing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:46.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。好。这样吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. Fine. Okay, you know what?
