Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:57.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有工作。去做。禁比基尼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a job. Do it. Ban on bikinis?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.68,0:21:59.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。不行，我们会失去观众。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. No, we'd lose our audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.75,0:22:01.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不是公共电视，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're not PBS, okay?
