Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.63,0:22:14.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以是《学徒》遇上《永恒》？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, it's "The Apprentice" meets "Everlasting"?
