Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.17,0:22:19.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，等等，女孩们得竞争丈夫和工作，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, wait, girls have to compete for a husband and a job,
