Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.88,0:22:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}双关意，拜托。这主意很棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pun intended. Come on. It's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.75,0:22:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了。你的咖啡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's awesome. Here's your coffee.
