Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.63,0:22:42.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，就到这里，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, that is a cut, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.73,0:22:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎来到快乐的老英格兰，亲爱的们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to merry, old England, darlings.
