Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.02,0:23:15.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我又去找了格蕾丝，那姑娘寸步不让。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I went back to Grace that girl will not budge.
