Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.93,0:23:22.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，不管我们怎么出招，她就是不肯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, no matter what we throw at her, she's just not gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.17,0:23:24.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我干脆让亚当回头找安娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just gonna get Adam back into Anna.
