Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.18,0:23:39.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心。要我试试吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry. You want me to try?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.79,0:23:41.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，反正现在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, 'cause it's not like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.25,0:23:43.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他也不会听你这女朋友的建议了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he's taking girlfriend advice from you at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.19,0:23:45.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道吗？我终于找到个王牌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? I finally found myself a ringer.
