Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.51,0:24:06.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，我在米克·贾格尔的……你懂的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, I was snorting blow off Mick Jagger's... you know
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.81,0:24:10.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上面吸可卡因，两天后就为头衔嫁给一个不举的公爵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}two days before I married an impotent duke for his title.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.08,0:24:13.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然这样，我想你会很喜欢这些姑娘的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, if that's the case, I think you're really gonna love these girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.22,0:24:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}名字……呃！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The names... Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.75,0:24:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不需要名字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't need names.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.96,0:24:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}A号机，抬头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Camera "A," eyes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.66,0:24:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.19,0:24:23.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女王殿下，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her royal highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.86,0:24:27.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三明治公爵夫人，卡米尔·克伦威尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the Duchess of Sandwich, Camille Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.84,0:24:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们，请就座。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Young ladies, please take your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.07,0:24:35.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我随后就来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.21,0:24:37.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.64,0:24:40.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是他祖母。你怎么知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's his grandmother. How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.08,0:24:41.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荡妇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.85,0:24:43.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里有谁跟我孙子睡过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who here has slept with my grandson?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.76,0:24:51.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奶奶，这些姑娘你喜欢哪个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, Granny, which of these girls do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.59,0:24:54.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只需要个画片新娘，一个凯特·米德尔顿，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just need a picture bride, a Kate Middleton,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.59,0:24:57.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能生漂亮孩子、会摆姿势的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}someone to make pretty babies and pose well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.30,0:24:59.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得格蕾丝正合适。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think Grace is perfect for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.73,0:25:01.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个拉美姑娘？亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Latin one? Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.07,0:25:03.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，但她父亲是养马的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, but her father's a horse breeder.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.80,0:25:05.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他有很多地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's got plenty of land.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.14,0:25:07.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她很聪明。哦，她真可口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's quite smart. Oh, she's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.71,0:25:10.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我相信你们俩有过愉快的欢愉，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure the two of you have had a lovely romp,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.74,0:25:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们不娶棕色人种……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but we don't marry brown people...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.58,0:25:13.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就是不娶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We just don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.88,0:25:15.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}另一个呢，那个瓷娃娃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about the other one, the porcelain doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.28,0:25:16.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她叫什么？安娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's her name? Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.68,0:25:17.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就那个。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That one. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.98,0:25:20.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她具备一种最可贵的品质\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She possesses one of the most glorious traits
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.09,0:25:21.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很少有美国人有的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}few Americans have...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.59,0:25:24.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她知道什么时候该闭上她的臭嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She knows when to keep her bloody mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.29,0:25:27.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且她好像对家族有些了解。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And she seems to know a bit about the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.23,0:25:29.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得他们会更喜欢她吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think they would like her better?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.86,0:25:32.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想重新赢得克伦威尔家的欢心，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want to get back in the Cromwells' good graces,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.36,0:25:34.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}娶那个小娃娃，开始生继承人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}marry the little doll, start popping out heirs...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.00,0:25:36.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有人都会跑着回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The whole lot will come running.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.74,0:25:39.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管怎样，你似乎需要这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Either way, it seems you might need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.17,0:25:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:44.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我可以把这当作你的祝福了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, I can take this as your blessing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.01,0:25:46.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就庆幸吧，没让你娶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just be thankful you're not getting
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.68,0:25:48.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们硬塞给你的某个马牙丑表亲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}some hideous, horse-toothed cousin we foisted on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.95,0:25:50.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时代变好了，我的宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Times have changed for the better, my poppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.78,0:25:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.79,0:25:59.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天，就在这个花园里，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Today, here in this garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.32,0:26:03.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当将向剩下的其中一位姑娘求婚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam will propose to one of our remaining ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.13,0:26:06.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果她接受，她将迈出第一步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Should she accept, she will take her first step
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.67,0:26:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成为公主，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to becoming a princess
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.03,0:26:10.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天她将在电视直播中嫁给亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as she weds Adam tomorrow on live television.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.37,0:26:13.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我并不在王位继承序列里吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I'm not in line to be the prince or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.34,0:26:16.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这节目什么时候在乎过事实？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Since when do we care about facts on this show?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.11,0:26:18.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.04,0:26:20.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别说了。出去吧。他来了，姑娘们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Enough talking. Get out there. He's coming, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.65,0:26:22.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你美极了。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look fantastic. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.31,0:26:25.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当，你准备好求婚了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, Adam, are you ready to pop the question?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.05,0:26:28.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}经过深思熟虑，是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After much consideration, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.09,0:26:31.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们每一位都非常出色，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Each of you are so remarkable,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.76,0:26:35.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能想象和你们大多数人的未来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I can imagine my life with most of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.09,0:26:37.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就豁出去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.96,0:26:40.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.84,0:26:45.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我们之间那种强烈的联系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know the powerful connection that we shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.81,0:26:53.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但抱歉，你就是不适合当我的妻子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I'm sorry, you're just not my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.45,0:27:01.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.29,0:27:08.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天看到你在我国家、和我家人在一起……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}seeing you here today in my country with my family...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.73,0:27:12.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我意识到你多么完美地融入这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I realize how beautifully you fit in here
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.26,0:27:17.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们多么般配，而我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and how beautifully we fit, and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.74,0:27:20.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只希望你也这么觉得。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}only hope that you feel the same way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.37,0:27:22.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也这么觉得。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.84,0:27:24.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你好运，安娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good luck with that, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.44,0:27:26.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.15,0:27:33.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}A机，能推近那套王室鬼话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Camera "A," can you push in on the royal bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.22,0:27:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}B机，请对准格蕾丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Camera B, please stay on Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.72,0:27:39.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，去吧，麦迪逊，去做采访。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, go, Madison, get the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.29,0:27:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我想看鸽子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I wanted to see the doves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.99,0:27:43.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，那不是白鸽，就是刷成白色的鸽子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, they're not doves, they're just pigeons painted white.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.13,0:27:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.23,0:27:47.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来自佐治亚州亚特兰大的安娜·马丁，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna Martin of Atlanta, Georgia,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.07,0:27:50.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你愿意嫁给我，让我成为世界上最幸运的男人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}will you marry me and make me the luckiest man in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.30,0:27:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意，当然愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.04,0:27:53.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.40,0:27:55.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那条裙子太美了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That dress is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.21,0:27:57.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-看那枚戒指。  -我爱你，亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, look at that ring.   -I love you, Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.91,0:28:00.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我也爱你。  -放鸽子吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And I love you.   -Go, doves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.45,0:28:02.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放鸽子，放鸽子，放鸽子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doves, doves, doves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.98,0:28:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，真不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. That is pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.92,0:28:09.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在去把安娜拉过来，别让她被那颗恶魔石头迷晕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now go grab Anna before she gets hypnotized by that devil rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.92,0:28:12.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，能跟你谈谈吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, can I talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.26,0:28:14.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.06,0:28:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位，呃，我想问问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody, um, I was just wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.53,0:28:18.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能不能请大家听我说几句？现在……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if I could have your attention for a minute? Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.80,0:28:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米，你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.43,0:28:22.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃，我想你们都知道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I, uh, I think you guys know...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.07,0:28:24.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可能知道得有点太多了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little bit too much, probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.47,0:28:28.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于，呃，这个女人和我的关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About, uh, this woman and my relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.07,0:28:31.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我爱你，永远都爱，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know that I love you, always will,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.41,0:28:35.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你再也找不到比你更爱你的人了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you'll never find anybody who loves you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.05,0:28:39.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，既然我们在这么浪漫的地方，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, while we're in the incredibly romantic place,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.42,0:28:42.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想问问你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just wondering if I could ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.82,0:28:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.76,0:28:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想在大家面前问你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wanted to ask here in front of everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.96,0:28:53.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.26,0:28:55.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.84,0:29:00.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得我有多蠢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How stupid do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.38,0:29:09.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，瑞秋……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, Rach...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.32,0:29:10.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于亚当的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.52,0:29:14.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还要让我当多少次傻瓜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How many times are you gonna make me look like a fool
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.52,0:29:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这些人、我家人面前？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in front of these people, my family?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.96,0:29:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要让他们听到这些，以防我再次失控，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I needed them to hear this in case I ever lose it again
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.19,0:29:22.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以为你不是毒药。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and think you're anything less than poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.86,0:29:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收起来。你知道我以前总说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put that away. You know how I always used to say
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.23,0:29:26.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这节目对你有害\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that the show's bad for you
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.00,0:29:28.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会把你丑陋的一面引出来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and how it brings out the ugliness in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.87,0:29:30.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我错了，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was wrong, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.97,0:29:33.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丑陋的是你自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's you that's ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.27,0:29:36.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我们不只是完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we're not just done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.54,0:29:41.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要确保你再也不能这样伤害任何人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna make sure you never hurt anyone like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.61,0:29:44.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？布兰妮，冷静点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Britney, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.08,0:29:46.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接招吧，贱人！好了，布兰妮，带走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take that, bitch! All right, Britney, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.42,0:29:48.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位，回去干活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody, back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.15,0:29:50.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们还有场婚礼要制作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've still got a wedding to produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.94,0:30:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，别这样！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God, don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.94,0:30:07.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.04,0:30:09.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一大早就这么盯着我看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at me so early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.44,0:30:11.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你感觉好点了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you feeling any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.41,0:30:14.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我没事。好，很好，起来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm fine. Okay, great. Well, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.18,0:30:17.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以前见过你那种眼神，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've seen that look in your eyes before, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.98,0:30:21.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你被双重甩了，已经濒临崩溃，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know you got double dumped and you're on the edge,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.25,0:30:24.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但今天不是你能发疯的日子，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but today is not the day that you get to lose your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.02,0:30:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听见没？坐下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you hear me? Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.56,0:30:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天你可以去跳金门大桥，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tomorrow, you can jump off the Golden Gate Bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.03,0:30:33.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冲进车流，随便你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}walk into traffic, whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.16,0:30:35.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但今天，我需要你打起精神。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but today, I need you on your toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.57,0:30:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你按计划行事，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to stick with the plan, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.57,0:30:40.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能做到吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Think you can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.54,0:30:42.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼，很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.04,0:30:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道该做什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what you need to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.91,0:30:45.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.18,0:30:47.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就去做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then go do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.12,0:30:54.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，花都摆上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, we got flowers going.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.19,0:30:56.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看起来挺不错吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looks pretty good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.32,0:30:59.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.20,0:31:11.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这是在干什么？我只想跟你谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are we doing? I just want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.60,0:31:13.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.60,0:31:15.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，肯定发生了什么，有些东西变了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, something happened, something changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.34,0:31:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很想知道是什么。你什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I really want to know what it is. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.48,0:31:19.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我承受得住。我要你告诉我实话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I can handle it. I want you to tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.21,0:31:21.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是床上的事不好，还是我说错了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Was the sex bad or was it something that I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.21,0:31:23.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，我们谈过这个。你说一切都好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, we talked about this. You said that everything was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.48,0:31:24.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不好。我不好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it's not fine. I'm not fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.02,0:31:27.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨天你还在求我跟你一起远走高飞，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yesterday, you were begging me to run away with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.25,0:31:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}六小时后，你就说你改主意了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and six hours later, you say you changed your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.39,0:31:32.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肯定发生了什么事，我真的很想知道是什么，亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Something happened and I really want to know what it is, Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.52,0:31:35.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，瑞秋，好吧，我们……我们可以谈这个，但换个时间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, Rachel, okay, we... we can talk about this, but another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.19,0:31:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在得去参加婚礼……我的婚礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to go to a wedding right now... my wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.23,0:31:38.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得信守那个承诺。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to honor that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.46,0:31:40.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}信守承诺？！你要信守那场婚礼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honor?! You're gonna honor that wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.20,0:31:41.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那场婚礼是个谎言……我们都知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That wedding is a lie... We both know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.70,0:31:43.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么……对，当然是个谎言，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking... Yeah, of course it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.44,0:31:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我还是得让它看起来是真的，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I still have to make it look real, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.07,0:31:46.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}否则这一切都白费了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Otherwise, this has all gone to waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.57,0:31:48.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有葡萄园，没有公开的洗白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No vineyard, no public rehabilitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.24,0:31:49.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}万一你爱上她了呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What if you fall in love with her
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.01,0:31:52.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让她怀孕，跟她生孩子呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you get her pregnant and you have, like, children with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.44,0:31:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那真的有可能发生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That could really happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.11,0:31:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我年底就会申请撤销婚姻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going to annul at the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.52,0:31:58.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Anna是很好，但什么……我是说，爱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna's sweet, but wha... I mean, love?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.75,0:32:01.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，你就告诉我我到底哪里有问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, just tell me what's wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.52,0:32:03.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我没时间耗这个。就告诉我我哪里有问题！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, look, I don't have time for this. Just tell me what's wrong with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.76,0:32:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.06,0:32:08.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。我只是需要知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. I just need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.07,0:32:25.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，作为朋友，我只是想让你知道你要卷入什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, as a friend, I just wanted you to know what you were getting yourself into.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.44,0:32:26.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“作为朋友”……是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"As a friend"... Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.01,0:32:28.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，作为朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.45,0:32:33.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我是说……我这么做能得到什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I mean... what do I have to gain by doing all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.02,0:32:37.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打算怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.69,0:32:41.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会告诉你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.63,0:32:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失陪一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.78,0:33:01.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五分钟后开拍，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rolling in five, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.51,0:33:03.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点动起来。你跟Anna谈过了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's hustle. So, did you talk to Anna yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.42,0:33:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。七成把握她会来，不过是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. It's a 70/30 she's in, but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.28,0:33:09.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一小时前就开始给他灌酒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I started giving him shots an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.12,0:33:11.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得没问题了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.06,0:33:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}13季了，我们终于能在电视上直播婚礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}13 seasons, we finally get a live wedding on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.66,0:33:15.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会非常精彩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is gonna be fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.46,0:33:17.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄，你真是超越了自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you've outdone yourself, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.30,0:33:19.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有三分钟，各位。三分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three minutes, people. Three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.16,0:33:20.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，你准备好了就开始，宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, whenever you're ready, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.63,0:33:22.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道吗？这次我让你来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? I'm gonna let you do it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.60,0:33:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你的节目。没关系，一直都是你来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's your show. That's all right. You always do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.84,0:33:28.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是直播。哦，我不想抢你风头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is live. Oh, I don't want to steal your thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.11,0:33:34.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始了。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.28,0:33:37.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十秒后直播……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're going live in 10...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.68,0:33:40.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}9……8……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}9...8...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.42,0:33:41.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你从哪弄来那个的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.72,0:33:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}7……6……5……《难忘新郎》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}7...6... 5... A groom to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.49,0:33:46.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}4……3……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}4...3...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.46,0:33:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直播开始。嗯？开拍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Going live. Mm? Action.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.87,0:34:01.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}新娘呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's the bride?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.74,0:34:02.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她不会来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.84,0:34:04.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人看到Anna了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyone have eyes on Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.48,0:34:06.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.84,0:34:08.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}A机，你看到她了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Camera "A," do you see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.58,0:34:10.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在哪……她在，呃……她在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where... where is, uh... Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.68,0:34:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你找到新娘了吗？你知道新娘在哪吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got the bride? Do you know where the bride is?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.79,0:34:21.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你们可以坐下了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you guys can sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.73,0:34:25.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.60,0:34:28.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，Anna临阵退缩了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, Anna got cold feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.13,0:34:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这在《永恒》史上前所未有，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This has never happened before in the history of "Everlasting,"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.47,0:34:32.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.60,0:34:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有个落跑新娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we have a runaway bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.47,0:34:36.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.14,0:34:38.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，Adam，我真的不知道该怎么跟你说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, Adam, I really don't know how to say this to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.31,0:34:39.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.85,0:34:42.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要一个人回家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you are going home alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.88,0:34:46.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会有什么“皇家大改造”了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's gonna be no "Royal Renovations."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.28,0:34:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她不能这么说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She can't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.45,0:34:50.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Adam，你可以走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam, you're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.39,0:34:55.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，见鬼，我来带他走。怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hell, I'll take him. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.76,0:34:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？反正都是做戏，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? It's all for show, anyway, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.63,0:34:59.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Adam，你爱我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam, you love me
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.23,0:35:01.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就跟爱你这些女孩中的任何一个差不多，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about as much as you love any of these girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.40,0:35:02.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也就是一点都不爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which is not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.67,0:35:04.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.20,0:35:05.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停，停……进广告。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut, cut... Go to commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.77,0:35:08.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个节目的制作人，Chet……停，停，停。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The creator of this show, Chet... Cut, cut, cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.21,0:35:09.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把我弄进节目就是为了跟我上床。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brought me on the show to sleep with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.54,0:35:11.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个节目就是他的私人妓院。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This show is his personal whorehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.51,0:35:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.78,0:35:14.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Britney是……把她弄出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Britney is... Get her out of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.51,0:35:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把坏女孩带回来是Chet的主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was Chet's idea to bring back a bad girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.78,0:35:19.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她不能那么说。我们在直播啊，老兄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She can't say that. We're on live television, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.25,0:35:21.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}观众想相信这是真的。我搞得定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The audience wants to believe it's real. I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.39,0:35:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}观众需要相信这是真的。我搞得定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The audience needs to believe it's real. I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.66,0:35:26.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打算怎么办？切三号机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you gonna do? Go to three.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.19,0:35:29.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁去找一下Adam，拜托。好了，不是所有人都去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone find Adam, please. All right, not all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.26,0:35:32.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁去拍反应镜头。下去拍反应。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone get reactions. Down for reactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.20,0:35:33.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别下到场地里去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't go down to the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.66,0:35:35.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得往上走……这是直播电视。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got to go up... This is live television.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.67,0:35:36.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得解决这事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.87,0:35:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，呃，什么，我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, uh, what, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.44,0:35:41.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我只是个靠睡上位的小助理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I'm... I'm just a P.A. that slept my way to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.94,0:35:43.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三号机，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Camera three. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.74,0:35:45.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接下来我需要你的全力支持。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want your full support moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.58,0:35:46.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么都行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.95,0:35:48.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上就要丢工作了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm about to lose my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.81,0:35:50.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们毁了你的人生！有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They ruin your lives! Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.42,0:35:52.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁下去一下。我知道。我来处理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone go down. I know. I am on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.32,0:35:53.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}音频，切到Britney的麦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Audio mic, cut on Britney.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.89,0:35:56.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一号机，跟着Britney，像胶水一样黏住她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need Camera 1, follow Britney and stick with her like glue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.59,0:35:58.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}二号机，拍奶奶的反应。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need Camera 2, reactions on Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.89,0:36:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三号机，我要Adam的特写。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Camera 3, I need close-ups on Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.86,0:36:03.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，Rachel，我需要你叫保安进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, Rachel, I need you to get security in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.43,0:36:04.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把Britney弄出去。看吧，这就是他们的手段。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get Britney out. See, this is what they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.86,0:36:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来了。他们让你消失。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go. They make you disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.40,0:36:07.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Adam，告诉他们！Adam！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam, tell 'em! Adam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.93,0:36:09.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你跟着保安走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to follow the security guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.60,0:36:10.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Adam！二号机，你在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam! Where are you, Camera 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.80,0:36:12.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把手插屁股缝里了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is your hand up your ass crack?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.40,0:36:14.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要一台摄像机到外面后门，马上，快去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need a camera outside, out back, right now, and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.64,0:36:15.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.81,0:36:18.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得进行得挺顺利的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it's going pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.54,0:36:19.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别停，别停。Anna！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay on, stay on. Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.78,0:36:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我太老了，玩不动这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh, I'm too old for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.31,0:36:22.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，来吧。撤退。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, come on. Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.85,0:36:24.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撤退。撤退。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stand down. Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.28,0:36:25.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到顶上去，快。别挡在她面前。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get to the top, go. Out of her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.98,0:36:27.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜，你为什么要这么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna, why'd you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.79,0:36:31.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你们俩经历了那么多，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, after everything the two of you have been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.66,0:36:34.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肯定是很糟糕，才会让你，呃，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it must have been pretty bad, huh, for you to, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.03,0:36:40.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在婚礼上……离开他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}have left him... at the altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.94,0:36:49.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个小女孩都梦想这一天，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every little girl dreams of this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.01,0:36:51.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}梦想这一刻，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of this moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.68,0:36:55.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这不代表我会不惜一切去争取。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but that doesn't mean that I would go for it at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.05,0:36:57.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当我停下来，认真想了想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I stopped and I really thought
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.35,0:36:59.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和亚当在一起的日子……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about my time with Adam...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.92,0:37:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是真实的。这已经是最真实的了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's real. This is as real as it gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.55,0:37:03.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而和他共度一生的可能，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the possibility of a life with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.05,0:37:06.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我意识到他就是个出轨的烂人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I realized he's a cheating slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.82,0:37:09.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虽然我或许最终\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And while I might have eventually
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.86,0:37:12.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能原谅他这一点，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}been able to forgive him for that,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.90,0:37:18.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我得接受一个事实：他就是没那么聪明。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had to accept the fact that he's just not that smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.77,0:37:20.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个白痴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.51,0:37:24.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绝对不是适合我的男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Definitely not the man for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.45,0:37:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你继续看。你会喜欢的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you just keep watching. You're gonna love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.52,0:37:33.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。哦，我们这边都没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Absolutely. Oh, we're all good here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.08,0:37:35.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.89,0:37:37.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你干的？是你干的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You did this? Did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.66,0:37:39.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我？不。听着，安娜刚发现……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me? No. Look, Anna just found out...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.59,0:37:41.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你向我证明了，你不值得托付。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, like, you show me, you're a bad bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.99,0:37:43.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你和我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, you and me...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.16,0:37:46.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩跟我说了那些之后，我还能怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was I supposed to do after everything Quinn told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.10,0:37:49.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？等等……奎恩跟你说了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? I'm sorry... Quinn told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.40,0:37:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，她全告诉我了。全告诉什么了？她说了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, she told me everything. Everything what? What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.77,0:37:54.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说你因为精神问题住过院？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The hospitalizations with mental problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.64,0:37:56.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪……我从没住过院。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my... I was never hospitalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.94,0:37:58.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们跟我讲了去年所有的事，所以，我是说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They told me all about last year, so, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.98,0:38:00.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就说得通了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it made sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.81,0:38:03.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当，她骗了你，也骗了我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam, she lied to you and to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.42,0:38:05.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后呢，你就信了她？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, what, you just believed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.38,0:38:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者，你知道吗，也许你本来就愿意信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or, you know, maybe you wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.55,0:38:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.95,0:38:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.86,0:38:13.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.44,0:38:25.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.80,0:38:27.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么苦着脸，屹耳？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why the long face, Eeyore?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.01,0:38:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们赢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We won.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.71,0:38:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别告诉我你在浪费你的胜利时刻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please tell me that you are not wasting your victory lap
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.75,0:38:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为男人哭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}crying about boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.62,0:38:43.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想弄明白他为什么，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just trying to figure out why he, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.39,0:38:45.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂的，亚当那事到底怎么回事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, what happened with Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.56,0:38:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有什么想跟我说的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anything you want to tell me about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.60,0:38:56.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，别管“为什么”了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, forget the "why."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.74,0:38:59.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他甩了你。结束了。往前看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He dumped you. Done. Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.07,0:39:00.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，我挺想知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, I'm pretty interested
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.74,0:39:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次到底是为什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the why in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.48,0:39:08.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，你是说，为什么你没有在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, you mean, why you're not coming out of a blackout
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.48,0:39:09.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塔希提岛的沙滩上醒来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on the beach in Tahiti,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.75,0:39:12.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿内裤当枕头，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}using your panties as a pillow,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.18,0:39:13.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被甩了，然后意识到自己毁了自己的人生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}dumped and realizing you ruined your life
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.02,0:39:16.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就为了某个愚蠢自恋的玩偶男？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on some half-wit, narcissist man doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.66,0:39:20.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我就不能自己犯错吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I mean, God forbid I make my own mistakes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.03,0:39:23.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说得好像你犯的错还不够多似的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like you haven't made enough of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.20,0:39:29.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行。都怪我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. Blame it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.13,0:39:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我才不在乎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.64,0:39:33.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你应该跪下来，感谢不管哪路神仙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should be kneeling down, thanking whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.50,0:39:34.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没落得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you didn't end up
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.91,0:39:37.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成为《永恒》头号小报笑柄，明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as "Everlasting's" ultimate tabloid idiot, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.64,0:39:38.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是份礼物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.88,0:39:40.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}礼物？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.75,0:39:43.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.48,0:39:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱情很美好……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Love is swell...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.92,0:39:47.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但它不是你能用来构建人生的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it is not something you build a life around.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.79,0:39:49.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，有些人就是会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, some people do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.15,0:39:51.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，有些人？怎么，像玛丽那样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, some people? What, like Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.70,0:39:59.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真会说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.16,0:40:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.80,0:40:11.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们杀了人，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We killed somebody, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.11,0:40:16.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.12,0:40:20.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别再那么干了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's not do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.55,0:40:24.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.96,0:40:27.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又将是无聊透顶的一季\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just another mind-numbing season
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.56,0:40:29.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.59,0:40:30.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.70,0:40:32.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不叫《完美无缺》？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not "The Whole Package"?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.50,0:40:34.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得那主意还不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought that was kind of a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.70,0:40:36.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我是说，这名字不错，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I mean, it's a good title,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.17,0:40:37.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我觉得我们的观众不关心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I don't think our audience cares
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.00,0:40:39.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有工作的女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about girls who have jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.04,0:40:44.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随便吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.71,0:40:47.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是下一季别再有谋杀，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just no murder next season, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.18,0:40:48.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.95,0:40:51.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少别在幕后对参赛者下手，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at least not with the contestants behind the scenes,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.18,0:40:53.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不敢保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.82,0:40:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.59,0:41:01.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我是说，我肯定杰瑞米\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I mean, I'm sure Jeremy
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.26,0:41:03.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会想看我死……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}would like to see me dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.73,0:41:05.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.16,0:41:06.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.90,0:41:10.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他要是找你麻烦，我就砍了他的头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, he gives you any trouble, I'll have his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.18,0:41:22.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.68,0:41:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.88,0:41:28.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。告诉我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.12,0:41:34.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.12,0:41:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.00,0:41:45.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.11,0:41:53.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 无眠中拥抱着你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Sleeplessly embracing you
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.78,0:41:56.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 哈欠渴望着我 怪人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Yawn yearns into me Weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.82,0:41:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 海里还有更多的眼泪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Plenty more tears in the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.92,0:42:03.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 所以你终于用上了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* And so you finally use it
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.66,0:42:06.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 夜里你看见与我同床共枕 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Bedding with me you see at night *
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.12,0:42:09.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 你的心披着骑士铠甲 * 别在石头上走了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Your heart wears knight armor * Stop walking on the rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.66,0:42:12.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 松树之饥\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Hunger of the pine
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.78,0:42:26.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，戈德堡太太。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Mrs. Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.81,0:42:28.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.15,0:42:30.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真没想到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.08,0:42:32.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋……瑞秋和你在一起吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is... Is Rachel with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.62,0:42:35.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。其实我是为她来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. This is actually about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.25,0:42:37.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她又病得很重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's really sick again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.32,0:42:42.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得想想办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.76,0:42:45.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come in.
